	mentor: Sorry, gardener.
	mentor: I lost my composure for a moment.
	mentor: Proceed with your investigation.
	mentor: It is likely that my ability to contact you will be further hindered as you delve further underground,
	mentor: But I will speak with you as often as I can.
	mentor: In the meantime, Operator will provide support wherever possible.
	mentor: Lean on each other.
	mentor: It is important work you're doing...
	mentor: More important with every passing minute, it seems.
	mentor: And stay vigilant.
	mentor: By all appearances, you are entering their base now.
